WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.915
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.185 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.425 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:51.945 --> 01:55.225
That old lady went to do laundry with the kids.

5
01:55.305 --> 01:57.305
They won't be back until dusk.

6
01:58.745 --> 02:00.585
Plus, she is having a high fever.

7
02:01.185 --> 02:02.545
She can't get out of bed at all.

8
02:03.945 --> 02:05.345
You can practically do anything to her.

9
02:12.185 --> 02:14.665
-Is my gambling debt settled now? -Get lost!

10
02:15.945 --> 02:17.745
We have a deal!

11
02:28.345 --> 02:29.185
Who are you?

12
02:29.785 --> 02:31.265
I'm your husband.

13
02:31.345 --> 02:33.465
For once, your gambler of a father did not lie.

14
02:33.545 --> 02:35.425
You are in fact a belle.

15
02:35.505 --> 02:37.265
Today is my lucky day, then.

16
02:40.745 --> 02:43.265
Somebody! Help!

17
02:43.345 --> 02:44.705
How could you do this?

18
02:44.785 --> 02:47.225
Why would you sell your kind daughter off?

19
02:47.305 --> 02:48.345
-Money! -Do you know what you're doing?

20
02:48.425 --> 02:50.785
Whoever pays me 300 coins

21
02:50.865 --> 02:53.665
gets to be my son-in-law.

22
02:53.745 --> 02:56.265
300 coins.

23
02:56.345 --> 02:57.905
-Only 300 coins. -Have you no conscience?

24
02:59.385 --> 03:02.025
Be nice. Just give in, and you won't suffer much.

25
03:02.625 --> 03:03.625
Understand?

26
03:14.225 --> 03:15.305
What's happening?

27
03:16.185 --> 03:17.065
Help!

28
03:17.665 --> 03:18.505
You wench.

29
03:18.585 --> 03:21.225
I'll skin you alive.

30
03:21.305 --> 03:22.545
-I'll sell your sick mother -Help.

31
03:22.625 --> 03:24.625
and your sister to the brothel.

32
03:24.705 --> 03:26.225
They will never to rise again,

33
03:26.305 --> 03:28.905
trodden underfoot by thousands.

34
03:35.505 --> 03:38.465
Touch me and you'll wish you were dead.

35
03:57.625 --> 03:59.425
-It's so quiet in there. -Suddenly, it's silent.

36
03:59.505 --> 04:00.505
What is going on?

37
04:00.585 --> 04:02.105
Can you go in and check?

38
04:06.825 --> 04:08.425
She's out.

39
04:08.505 --> 04:09.425
So much blood.

40
04:09.505 --> 04:10.545
So much blood.

41
04:10.625 --> 04:12.105
She killed him?

42
04:16.305 --> 04:17.265
Pa.

43
04:18.665 --> 04:20.184
Your 300 coins.

44
04:24.105 --> 04:26.225
-It's a head! -Oh my!

45
04:46.385 --> 04:48.865
No, none of them is like her at all.

46
04:48.945 --> 04:49.985
Take them away.

47
04:50.585 --> 04:51.545
Move.

48
04:52.065 --> 04:53.025
Move.

49
04:53.545 --> 04:54.585
Forgive me.

50
04:54.665 --> 04:57.865
I told you to find a person, and this is what you got for me?

51
04:57.945 --> 04:59.145
Look at them.

52
04:59.225 --> 05:00.345
None of them is as alluring as Rao.

53
05:00.425 --> 05:02.665
It's difficult to find another beautiful woman

54
05:02.745 --> 05:04.505
like Lady Rao in the capital on short notice.

55
05:05.105 --> 05:07.105
I have visited every corner,

56
05:07.185 --> 05:08.465
and they are the ones who resemble her the most.

57
05:08.545 --> 05:12.065
Their eyes or manners are quite similar to hers.

58
05:12.145 --> 05:14.825
-Perhaps you can take another look? -How ridiculous.

59
05:15.865 --> 05:17.465
You're foolish and blind.

60
05:17.545 --> 05:19.785
Rao is an unrivaled beauty.

61
05:19.865 --> 05:21.145
A true gem.

62
05:21.225 --> 05:23.145
The creatures you found are nothing like her.

63
05:23.225 --> 05:24.265
Right, right.

64
05:24.345 --> 05:25.705
I'll look for more.

65
05:27.105 --> 05:28.745
Execute her!

66
05:29.945 --> 05:30.785
‎-Throw it at her. ‎-Stone her to death.

67
05:30.865 --> 05:32.105
-What is the ruckus? -Stone her to death.

68
05:32.185 --> 05:33.985
Acting in self-defense is enough to acquit her.

69
05:34.065 --> 05:35.385
Why did they sentence her to death?

70
05:35.465 --> 05:36.705
-Murderer! -You're a murderer!

71
05:36.785 --> 05:38.225
That's unjust.

72
05:38.305 --> 05:39.465
Justice?

73
05:39.545 --> 05:41.145
The dead man owned a gambling den.

74
05:41.225 --> 05:42.945
He was a great bully.

75
05:43.025 --> 05:47.665
I was told he spent a lot of money to hire a thug to…

76
05:47.745 --> 05:48.585
Enough!

77
05:48.665 --> 05:49.905
-Murderer! -Poor thing.

78
05:49.985 --> 05:50.825
-What a tragedy. -Move aside.

79
05:50.905 --> 05:52.105
-Don't make things up. -Don't make things up.

80
05:52.185 --> 05:53.225
Murderer.

81
05:53.745 --> 05:54.585
Murderer.

82
05:54.665 --> 05:55.745
Throw it at her!

83
05:56.265 --> 05:57.785
Murderer!

84
05:58.385 --> 06:01.145
-Throw it at her. -Throw it at her.

85
06:02.785 --> 06:04.265
Murderer!

86
06:05.425 --> 06:06.345
Throw it at her.

87
06:06.865 --> 06:08.745
-Throw it at her. -Stone her to death.

88
06:10.145 --> 06:11.105
-Stone her to death. -Stone her to death.

89
06:11.185 --> 06:12.505
An eye for an eye.

90
06:13.265 --> 06:14.745
-Die! -Go.

91
06:14.825 --> 06:16.945
Find out the background of the female prisoner

92
06:17.025 --> 06:19.105
-and the crime she committed. -Throw it at her.

93
06:19.185 --> 06:21.785
-Now! -Of course.

94
06:23.825 --> 06:24.665
Murderer.

95
06:24.745 --> 06:26.585
Luck is on my side.

96
06:26.665 --> 06:28.385
-You deserve death! -Throw it at her.

97
06:28.465 --> 06:31.105
Luck really is on my side.

98
06:32.465 --> 06:35.465
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

99
06:38.745 --> 06:39.945
-Hurry, this way. -Okay.

100
07:14.265 --> 07:15.385
Why did you kidnap me?

101
07:15.465 --> 07:18.865
Wash her. Then, I'll take a closer look.

102
07:19.545 --> 07:21.825
-Yes. -Come. Quick.

103
07:22.465 --> 07:23.465
What are you doing?

104
07:24.345 --> 07:25.185
What are you doing?

105
07:25.785 --> 07:27.025
What do you want?

106
07:27.105 --> 07:28.345
Clean her up.

107
07:28.425 --> 07:30.025
Don't touch me!

108
07:33.665 --> 07:35.425
You are right, Madam.

109
07:35.505 --> 07:36.865
According to our law,

110
07:36.945 --> 07:38.905
women who acted in self-defense during rape

111
07:38.985 --> 07:40.425
will be given 40 lashes.

112
07:41.025 --> 07:42.945
Their family can also pay a fine in lieu of the sentence.

113
07:43.825 --> 07:47.145
However, she is poor, so she was given a death sentence.

114
07:47.225 --> 07:48.745
I went to the court office with my name token

115
07:48.825 --> 07:50.585
and lied that she was my rogue servant.

116
07:50.665 --> 07:53.145
I claimed that the rapist was trying to damage our property.

117
07:53.745 --> 07:56.145
Besides, the Luo family had moved away overnight.

118
07:56.825 --> 07:59.425
The magistrate knew he had meted out an unfair judgment,

119
07:59.505 --> 08:00.745
so he didn't do much to stop me.

120
08:00.825 --> 08:04.865
I got her with just a few golden zhus.

121
08:05.545 --> 08:07.585
Good. You did well.

122
08:08.865 --> 08:10.985
First Madam, you can't enter.

123
08:11.505 --> 08:12.545
Madam!

124
08:14.465 --> 08:16.625
Yufeng, what brought you here?

125
08:22.105 --> 08:24.625
You brought someone in this late at night.

126
08:25.145 --> 08:26.945
Is it something you're trying to hide?

127
08:28.145 --> 08:30.625
Let's speak outside.

128
08:34.065 --> 08:35.505
We can do it here.

129
08:54.425 --> 08:57.665
You have always been very observant, Yufeng.

130
08:57.745 --> 08:59.545
We can never hide anything from you in this household.

131
09:00.545 --> 09:02.265
I never intended to keep this from you.

132
09:02.345 --> 09:04.745
Allow me to explain.

133
09:04.825 --> 09:05.945
Spare me.

134
09:06.625 --> 09:09.025
I know what you're up to.

135
09:10.025 --> 09:12.825
You ought to know that the Lus helped found our nation.

136
09:13.505 --> 09:15.505
They are a prestigious family,

137
09:15.585 --> 09:18.185
not a family that has fallen from grace.

138
09:18.265 --> 09:22.585
They will not be puppeteered by anyone.

139
09:23.185 --> 09:25.825
Your plan is way too bold.

140
09:26.345 --> 09:28.025
Calm down, Yufeng.

141
09:28.905 --> 09:30.065
As the saying goes,

142
09:30.145 --> 09:33.825
only a ruthless man can achieve greatness.

143
09:33.905 --> 09:36.985
They forced Rao to marry someone who is as good as dead,

144
09:37.065 --> 09:38.545
making her a widow for a lifetime.

145
09:39.065 --> 09:41.345
It's only fair for us to retaliate in kind.

146
09:42.265 --> 09:43.665
Among the four sons of the Duke,

147
09:43.745 --> 09:45.785
three fell on the battlefield.

148
09:45.865 --> 09:47.865
One is a cripple.

149
09:47.945 --> 09:50.465
Lu Zhuo is the only pillar in their family.

150
09:51.225 --> 09:52.385
With him gone,

151
09:53.145 --> 09:55.985
the Lu family is just a toothless tiger

152
09:56.505 --> 09:58.385
whose bite can never hurt.

153
09:58.465 --> 10:00.025
Don't you agree, Yufeng?

154
10:13.225 --> 10:15.865
Moreover, worried that Rao will be affected

155
10:15.945 --> 10:18.985
by the reputation of her birth mother, Zhou,

156
10:19.665 --> 10:22.025
Mother rarely allows Rao out all these years.

157
10:22.105 --> 10:23.745
Not many people have seen her.

158
10:23.825 --> 10:26.545
Besides, the Lu family is quite preoccupied

159
10:26.625 --> 10:27.985
with internal and external conflicts.

160
10:28.065 --> 10:30.785
They have no time to verify her identity.

161
10:31.385 --> 10:35.025
Once the marital rites have been carried out,

162
10:35.105 --> 10:38.745
it'll be too late to change anything.

163
10:39.905 --> 10:43.545
But what if Lu Zhuo survives?

164
10:45.025 --> 10:46.185
Impossible.

165
10:46.265 --> 10:48.985
Seven imperial physicians in the Imperial Medical Bureau affirm

166
10:49.065 --> 10:51.505
that he will die soon.

167
10:52.105 --> 10:58.185
It will take a huge miracle for him to survive.

168
10:58.865 --> 11:02.305
Then, after a year or two, when things have settled down,

169
11:02.385 --> 11:06.465
we'll marry Rao off somewhere far away as our adopted daughter.

170
11:06.545 --> 11:09.505
Now that's better than being a widow for the rest of her life.

171
11:11.385 --> 11:13.145
I see.

172
11:13.225 --> 11:15.105
You've always been stubborn.

173
11:15.865 --> 11:17.345
I can't talk you out of anything.

174
11:19.065 --> 11:21.065
Show her to me.

175
11:21.665 --> 11:23.185
If she doesn't look like her,

176
11:23.265 --> 11:25.145
your plan will not work anyway.

177
11:26.865 --> 11:27.705
Bring her out.

178
11:35.425 --> 11:36.985
Lift your head.

179
11:53.345 --> 11:54.505
Who are you?

180
11:54.585 --> 11:55.625
What do you think?

181
11:55.705 --> 11:59.625
Even you are taken aback, aren't you?

182
12:01.545 --> 12:04.225
She's as close as one could get.

183
12:04.825 --> 12:07.345
After we doll her up a little,

184
12:08.065 --> 12:10.505
no one will be able to tell them apart.

185
12:15.945 --> 12:17.225
Yufeng.

186
12:17.305 --> 12:18.585
Are you all right?

187
12:19.105 --> 12:20.825
You look distraught.

188
12:21.345 --> 12:22.345
So similar.

189
12:27.425 --> 12:28.545
So similar.

190
12:30.585 --> 12:31.585
But

191
12:32.465 --> 12:34.385
she's a bit too tanned.

192
12:35.905 --> 12:37.625
Her mannerisms

193
12:38.705 --> 12:41.345
need to be refined as well.

194
12:44.905 --> 12:48.425
This chamber is damp and stuffy. It makes me sick.

195
12:49.625 --> 12:52.865
I will head back now. Do what you must.

196
12:53.625 --> 12:54.705
Yufeng,

197
12:56.785 --> 13:00.705
please don't tell anyone about this.

198
13:01.305 --> 13:04.305
If Mother finds out, the plan will fall apart.

199
13:22.425 --> 13:24.065
A lowly prisoner on death row.

200
13:24.745 --> 13:25.945
Shouldn't you kneel before me?

201
13:28.385 --> 13:30.985
Madam, you went out of your way to save someone on death row.

202
13:32.385 --> 13:34.425
You certainly need something important from me.

203
13:35.145 --> 13:37.105
It is you who seeks a favor.

204
13:38.105 --> 13:39.185
You should be

205
13:40.385 --> 13:41.385
the one who kneels.

206
13:43.985 --> 13:44.945
-Insolent! -Wait.

207
13:48.425 --> 13:49.825
I love your audacity.

208
13:50.425 --> 13:53.665
It seems like I found the right person.

209
13:55.545 --> 13:56.625
Yes.

210
13:57.145 --> 13:59.545
I need you to do something for me.

211
14:01.425 --> 14:02.785
Do it well,

212
14:03.545 --> 14:06.545
and you'll have a life of wealth.

213
14:07.825 --> 14:09.305
Fail

214
14:09.985 --> 14:11.745
and you'll see the guillotine.

215
14:16.425 --> 14:17.625
In that case,

216
14:18.145 --> 14:20.865
a life of wealth is a faraway ideal

217
14:21.545 --> 14:23.185
that I must achieve by risking my life.

218
14:23.985 --> 14:26.745
I have to do everything, but I might end up with nothing.

219
14:27.745 --> 14:28.785
This won't work.

220
14:29.625 --> 14:32.865
Just send me back to the guillotine.

221
14:33.465 --> 14:34.425
Wait.

222
14:34.945 --> 14:35.985
You…

223
14:37.665 --> 14:39.105
What else do you want?

224
14:42.105 --> 14:43.265
Madam, you're back.

225
14:45.185 --> 14:48.705
Madam, what did I do this time?

226
14:48.785 --> 14:49.825
GOVERNESS CHANG

227
14:52.385 --> 14:53.545
Search her residence.

228
14:57.105 --> 15:01.025
Will you give me what I want?

229
15:04.305 --> 15:05.865
Gold or silver

230
15:08.065 --> 15:09.305
at your disposal.

231
15:10.305 --> 15:12.345
You are affluent and powerful.

232
15:14.185 --> 15:16.705
Something only a prisoner on death row can do

233
15:17.505 --> 15:19.185
must be something extremely dangerous.

234
15:23.345 --> 15:24.665
I want to see my parents

235
15:25.625 --> 15:28.185
and 50,000 coins.

236
15:29.385 --> 15:32.465
What? 50,000 coins?

237
15:33.545 --> 15:35.185
Greedy, aren't you?

238
15:35.265 --> 15:38.585
50,000 coins is enough to buy 10 beautiful entertainers.

239
15:41.625 --> 15:44.105
I'm stupid, clumsy, and can't dance.

240
15:45.345 --> 15:47.745
Perhaps you can ask the entertainers to do the job.

241
15:47.825 --> 15:48.705
You…

242
15:54.905 --> 15:56.265
Fine.

243
15:57.185 --> 15:58.985
It's nothing.

244
15:59.505 --> 16:00.705
You'll have it.

245
16:01.705 --> 16:02.825
Guards!

246
16:03.345 --> 16:04.705
Take her away.

247
16:04.785 --> 16:09.385
Have her properly perfumed. Get that stink of poverty off her.

248
16:15.865 --> 16:17.545
I didn't do it, Madam.

249
16:19.705 --> 16:20.905
Madam.

250
16:20.985 --> 16:23.385
I didn't do it.

251
16:23.465 --> 16:26.625
I have served you half my life.

252
16:26.705 --> 16:29.105
Why won't you trust me?

253
16:39.425 --> 16:40.705
Madam.

254
16:41.425 --> 16:45.185
I carry out your orders dutifully.

255
16:45.265 --> 16:47.745
Some wicked gossip mongers

256
16:47.825 --> 16:50.385
must have plotted to make you doubt me.

257
16:50.465 --> 16:51.585
Smash it open.

258
16:59.345 --> 17:02.065
It was I who poured in

259
17:02.905 --> 17:06.865
the boiling quick lime back then.

260
17:07.464 --> 17:10.785
In an instant, the body dissolved.

261
17:10.865 --> 17:11.704
It was so scary!

262
17:12.545 --> 17:14.224
If it weren't for this piece of evidence,

263
17:14.745 --> 17:17.424
I would have died unjustly!

264
17:26.704 --> 17:28.865
You have followed me for a long time.

265
17:28.945 --> 17:30.385
Of course, I trust you.

266
17:31.145 --> 17:32.665
I just need

267
17:33.465 --> 17:34.945
reassurance.

268
17:35.705 --> 17:37.145
Thank you, Madam.

269
17:39.305 --> 17:42.825
Could this just be a coincidence?

270
17:50.225 --> 17:51.785
Crying? Why are you crying?

271
17:52.385 --> 17:54.545
We have found ourselves a generous donor.

272
17:54.625 --> 17:55.865
50,000 coins!

273
17:56.665 --> 17:59.065
Your flesh and bones

274
17:59.145 --> 18:00.625
won't even get me 10 coins.

275
18:03.025 --> 18:04.585
I sold myself to the Wei family.

276
18:05.145 --> 18:06.545
From now on, you won't be my parents anymore.

277
18:07.345 --> 18:09.945
We might not see each other again.

278
18:11.505 --> 18:14.945
I would like to speak to Mother in private.

279
18:15.545 --> 18:17.025
Sure.

280
18:17.105 --> 18:18.985
Go ahead.

281
18:19.065 --> 18:20.105
I'll just count my coins.

282
18:28.265 --> 18:30.305
An indenture is not worth 50,000 coins.

283
18:30.385 --> 18:33.025
You can't take the money.

284
18:49.105 --> 18:50.305
Ma.

285
18:50.985 --> 18:52.105
From now on,

286
18:53.025 --> 18:54.705
I won't be able to look after you.

287
18:55.385 --> 18:57.505
Please lead a good life with my brothers and sisters.

288
18:58.945 --> 19:00.465
Forget I ever existed.

289
19:00.545 --> 19:03.665
I don't need it. Keep it for yourself.

290
19:10.425 --> 19:12.705
We have to be there before dawn. It's time to go.

291
19:21.065 --> 19:23.665
It's time to go. Come now.

292
19:29.025 --> 19:29.865
Go.

293
19:35.065 --> 19:36.545
Let's go.

294
19:36.625 --> 19:38.665
They even gave me a plot of land to manage.

295
19:38.745 --> 19:40.465
We're going to be rich.

296
19:40.545 --> 19:44.505
Our daughter is having a comfortable life. What's there to worry about? Let's go.

297
19:45.025 --> 19:46.225
My daughter.

298
19:47.145 --> 19:48.025
My daughter.

299
19:54.665 --> 19:55.545
My daughter.

300
20:11.385 --> 20:14.985
FIVE DAYS LATER

301
20:17.945 --> 20:19.545
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

302
20:52.225 --> 20:53.625
I am Lu Ya from the Duke's Residence,

303
20:54.225 --> 20:55.705
here to pick up the bride on behalf of my brother.

304
20:55.785 --> 20:56.665
FOWL OF PROSPERITY

305
20:56.745 --> 20:59.225
Bride, please enter the carriage.

306
21:01.265 --> 21:03.425
LU YA, ELDEST SON OF THE SECOND WIFE OF THE DUKE OF YING

307
21:10.545 --> 21:12.465
Mother, the auspicious hour is upon us.

308
21:13.065 --> 21:15.185
Time to have Rao get into the horse carriage.

309
21:18.185 --> 21:19.665
Wait.

310
21:21.545 --> 21:23.065
Look. A carriage from Lady Shou'an.

311
21:23.665 --> 21:24.705
Who is Lady Shou'an?

312
21:24.785 --> 21:27.025
The distant grandmother of the bride.

313
21:31.185 --> 21:32.865
I told you not to tell her.

314
21:32.945 --> 21:33.785
Why did she come?

315
21:34.465 --> 21:37.185
You think you can hide everything just because you want to?

316
21:38.465 --> 21:40.385
LADY SHOU'AN

317
21:53.105 --> 21:56.145
Old Madam Wei, you sure

318
21:56.225 --> 21:59.465
have picked a great suitor for Rao.

319
22:01.465 --> 22:04.065
Do not look around. It is unbecoming.

320
22:05.625 --> 22:07.145
We should have sent someone to greet you.

321
22:07.225 --> 22:09.865
Why don't we speak inside?

322
22:12.425 --> 22:15.145
A coward who's too gutless to do anything.

323
22:16.145 --> 22:20.185
What? Afraid that others would think you sell your niece off

324
22:20.265 --> 22:21.665
to please the Duke?

325
22:22.625 --> 22:24.985
Or do you fear the pointing fingers

326
22:25.065 --> 22:26.985
that you can't even protect the only daughter

327
22:27.065 --> 22:28.105
of your younger brother?

328
22:28.705 --> 22:30.985
The marriage between both families has long been arranged.

329
22:31.065 --> 22:34.185
The heir to the Duke of Ying is handsome

330
22:34.265 --> 22:36.145
and is a protector of the nation.

331
22:36.225 --> 22:40.625
If my granddaughter can bring them peace and prosperity,

332
22:40.705 --> 22:42.945
or even cure my grandson-in-law,

333
22:43.625 --> 22:45.185
that's her honor.

334
22:47.465 --> 22:48.745
Do not interrupt us.

335
23:00.665 --> 23:02.185
Mother had to make difficult decisions.

336
23:02.265 --> 23:03.985
Lady Shou'an, you accused her wrongly

337
23:04.065 --> 23:05.425
without knowing the full story.

338
23:05.505 --> 23:08.065
We are part of a bigger family.

339
23:08.145 --> 23:09.665
Lest the outsiders gossip about us,

340
23:10.425 --> 23:13.625
I invite you to talk in private inside the house.

341
23:14.425 --> 23:15.745
No need.

342
23:15.825 --> 23:18.065
We are no longer a family.

343
23:18.145 --> 23:21.585
I came here today to give my granddaughter some gifts.

344
23:27.545 --> 23:29.265
As per His Majesty's decree,

345
23:29.345 --> 23:30.945
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

346
23:31.025 --> 23:33.385
"Lu Zhuo, the heir to the Duke of Ying,

347
23:33.465 --> 23:36.585
is a valiant warrior

348
23:36.665 --> 23:39.265
who has protected our society from invaders.

349
23:39.865 --> 23:42.105
The daughter of the Earl of Cheng'an

350
23:42.185 --> 23:45.145
is a prestigious woman of virtues

351
23:45.225 --> 23:48.545
and embodies the morals of feminine codes.

352
23:49.305 --> 23:53.545
To extend my well wishes for their eternal union,

353
23:54.145 --> 23:57.425
the bride shall be bestowed a set of golden crowns and hairpins,

354
23:57.505 --> 23:59.425
and one crimson ritual garment.

355
24:00.025 --> 24:02.425
These gifts will exalt the bride's virtue and worthiness

356
24:02.505 --> 24:05.505
and honor the loyalty of our valiant defender of the realm."

357
24:06.585 --> 24:09.105
Thank you, Your Majesty.

358
24:16.065 --> 24:17.585
It is indeed a golden crown.

359
24:18.185 --> 24:19.185
No one can wear it

360
24:19.265 --> 24:21.865
except for the Empress Dowager, the Empress, and the consorts.

361
24:21.945 --> 24:24.945
So someone in the palace is voicing support for the daughter.

362
24:25.545 --> 24:27.705
Wear the crown and lift the fan!

363
24:27.785 --> 24:29.025
Please don't do it!

364
24:30.665 --> 24:32.345
Greetings, Lady Shou'an.

365
24:32.865 --> 24:34.025
I believe the groom

366
24:34.785 --> 24:37.545
should be the one to remove the fan.

367
24:39.265 --> 24:42.825
Him? He's in bed, unconscious.

368
24:42.905 --> 24:43.745
How can he lift the fan?

369
24:44.865 --> 24:45.865
Just back off.

370
25:02.745 --> 25:05.025
You're worried it's bad luck too, right?

371
25:07.305 --> 25:11.265
Fine. I won't remove your fan.

372
25:11.985 --> 25:13.265
I'll walk you to the carriage.

373
25:21.025 --> 25:22.225
Grandmother.

374
25:24.065 --> 25:25.225
Good girl.

375
25:42.865 --> 25:43.745
Wei Rao.

376
25:44.465 --> 25:47.345
You're so lucky to have grandparents

377
25:47.425 --> 25:48.865
who care so much about you.

378
25:49.505 --> 25:52.825
Allow me to repay their kindness on your behalf.

379
26:06.145 --> 26:10.105
MAY JOY ALWAYS FIND YOU MAY WE NEVER BE FORGOTTEN TO EACH OTHER

380
26:18.865 --> 26:20.945
The Weis and the Lus have long had a marital arrangement.

381
26:21.585 --> 26:23.545
The groom is heavily injured and needs a celebration to turn his luck over.

382
26:24.345 --> 26:28.225
That said, Wei Rao has given her heart to her childhood playmate and cousin.

383
26:28.305 --> 26:30.665
She refuses to marry into the Lu family.

384
26:30.745 --> 26:32.585
I bought you for 50,000 coins.

385
26:32.665 --> 26:35.465
If Lu Zhuo lives, you can enjoy a comfortable life.

386
26:35.545 --> 26:39.105
If he dies, you'll deal with the hardship alone.

387
26:39.185 --> 26:43.425
From now on, fate will decide your life. You have no one to blame.

388
26:43.505 --> 26:44.425
A-Chou,

389
26:46.105 --> 26:47.465
from now on,

390
26:48.145 --> 26:50.625
you are Lady Wei Rao,

391
26:50.705 --> 26:52.865
the new bride of the Duke of Ying's family.

392
26:56.425 --> 26:59.945
You are Wei Rao.

393
27:08.905 --> 27:10.345
What are you doing?

394
27:10.425 --> 27:11.425
Come in here.

395
27:18.065 --> 27:19.665
How dare you?

396
27:19.745 --> 27:22.225
If someone recognizes you, our plan will be ruined.

397
27:22.305 --> 27:23.585
She is wearing my golden crown!

398
27:24.985 --> 27:26.905
And she is the new bride of the Duke of Ying's family.

399
27:26.985 --> 27:30.425
But I have to hide myself from everyone.

400
27:31.265 --> 27:32.225
It's so unfair.

401
27:33.305 --> 27:36.425
A lowly woman gets to enjoy nobility

402
27:36.945 --> 27:38.945
and a life of abundance for nothing.

403
27:39.025 --> 27:42.505
Everything in this life comes with a price.

404
27:43.345 --> 27:47.025
The heir was seriously injured while he served our nation.

405
27:47.865 --> 27:51.305
The bride comes from a miserable background.

406
27:52.665 --> 27:56.145
Instead of turning the luck around, she might worsen it.

407
27:56.225 --> 27:59.425
Then, in grief and sorrow,

408
27:59.505 --> 28:03.105
she might follow her husband's footsteps by hanging herself.

409
28:03.705 --> 28:05.385
That's normal, isn't it?

410
28:06.065 --> 28:07.225
In the end,

411
28:07.305 --> 28:10.345
it makes our family look good.

412
28:11.505 --> 28:13.225
So you already have a plan, Aunt?

413
28:13.305 --> 28:14.705
I do everything for you.

414
28:15.305 --> 28:17.345
Of course, I know what you want.

415
28:17.945 --> 28:19.265
You're not one

416
28:20.225 --> 28:23.425
to allow others to take your spot and glory.

417
28:32.225 --> 28:33.225
However,

418
28:33.905 --> 28:36.385
you must bear with me for the moment.

419
28:36.905 --> 28:39.025
There are many eyes back home.

420
28:39.545 --> 28:42.425
You should stay in our secondary residence for now.

421
28:43.145 --> 28:45.905
In case of over hearing,

422
28:46.425 --> 28:48.585
when you go out, don't go by the name Rao.

423
28:50.185 --> 28:52.025
What should I call myself then?

424
28:56.985 --> 28:57.825
Jundai.

425
28:59.105 --> 29:00.345
Jundai it is.

426
29:01.345 --> 29:02.825
Jundai.

427
29:06.065 --> 29:07.905
I like the sound of it.

428
29:07.985 --> 29:09.865
I can't wait to see

429
29:11.065 --> 29:13.945
how that lowly woman will fare.

430
29:16.185 --> 29:18.905
FIVE DAYS AGO

431
29:25.505 --> 29:27.745
HONGXIAN, A-CHOU'S YOUNGER SISTER

432
29:33.625 --> 29:35.785
Ma, I need to use the toilet.

433
29:36.745 --> 29:37.785
Me too.

434
29:37.865 --> 29:38.705
RUNSHENG, A-CHOU'S YOUNGER BROTHER

435
29:38.785 --> 29:40.065
Halt!

436
29:41.665 --> 29:43.265
My daughter needs to use the loo.

437
29:43.345 --> 29:44.865
Can we stop in front?

438
29:45.705 --> 29:47.705
Besides, it's quite warm.

439
29:47.785 --> 29:49.705
You two can rest and have some cold tea.

440
29:49.785 --> 29:50.865
It won't take too long.

441
29:51.665 --> 29:53.105
Come. Halt.

442
30:02.105 --> 30:03.105
Over here.

443
30:14.745 --> 30:16.425
Superintendent Jin, have some tea.

444
30:17.625 --> 30:18.625
Here you go.

445
30:18.705 --> 30:19.825
Thanks.

446
30:37.025 --> 30:39.625
Ma, at night, sleep with one eye open.

447
30:40.345 --> 30:42.065
If the journey leads to somewhere more and more remote,

448
30:42.585 --> 30:44.105
they might be up to something.

449
30:45.665 --> 30:48.585
Your asthma medicine contains henbane flower.

450
30:49.105 --> 30:50.825
It has a soporific effect.

451
30:51.545 --> 30:54.545
Mix it with tea and feed it to the coachmen.

452
30:55.385 --> 30:56.425
Let's go.

453
31:13.825 --> 31:14.665
Let's go.

454
31:28.705 --> 31:30.265
Wake up. Those three ran away.

455
31:30.945 --> 31:32.665
Who? Who ran away?

456
31:33.505 --> 31:34.585
It's almost dawn.

457
31:35.265 --> 31:36.145
It's too late.

458
31:36.745 --> 31:37.905
Get rid of the guy first.

459
31:37.985 --> 31:40.025
We'll bury him in the woods and report back.

460
31:40.105 --> 31:41.705
Don't tell anyone about this.

461
31:43.305 --> 31:45.385
Think you can get 50,000 coins for free?

462
31:45.465 --> 31:47.265
That's the worth of your entire family.

463
31:52.985 --> 31:56.585
SONGYUE HALL, DUKE'S RESIDENCE

464
32:08.185 --> 32:09.625
So, he is Lu Zhuo.

465
32:14.105 --> 32:15.145
The heir is sick.

466
32:15.225 --> 32:16.945
The marital rites had to be simplified.

467
32:17.025 --> 32:17.905
I hope you don't mind.

468
32:18.945 --> 32:21.705
Old Madam is afraid that having his mother here will only upset her.

469
32:21.785 --> 32:23.905
So she is receiving guests at the banquet hall now.

470
32:23.985 --> 32:25.505
But Old Madam is also aware that it's your first time here,

471
32:25.585 --> 32:27.185
so she asks me to keep you company here.

472
32:27.265 --> 32:29.825
You may let me know if you need anything.

473
32:29.905 --> 32:30.745
KONG YINGSHU FOURTH DAUGHTER-IN-LAW AT DUKE'S RESIDENCE

474
32:30.825 --> 32:32.265
I am the heir's Fourth Aunt.

475
32:32.985 --> 32:34.265
Greetings, Fourth Aunt.

476
32:35.465 --> 32:37.705
It is warm tonight.

477
32:37.785 --> 32:38.865
Why are you wearing gloves?

478
32:52.425 --> 32:54.185
I was careless in my needlework

479
32:54.705 --> 32:57.065
and pricked myself while I was getting ready for the marriage.

480
32:57.145 --> 32:58.785
My hands are full of scars.

481
32:58.865 --> 33:00.145
I am embarrassed to show them.

482
33:00.745 --> 33:01.985
That's why I wear gloves.

483
33:03.345 --> 33:04.665
I see.

484
33:05.265 --> 33:07.185
I was told that your name is Rao.

485
33:07.265 --> 33:08.625
I shall call you Rao then.

486
33:09.545 --> 33:10.945
Lu Zhuo is still unconscious.

487
33:11.025 --> 33:13.425
Allow me to lift the fan veil on his behalf.

488
33:14.385 --> 33:15.665
Thank you, Fourth Aunt.

489
33:24.825 --> 33:25.865
Oh my.

490
33:25.945 --> 33:27.425
You're so pretty.

491
33:27.505 --> 33:31.225
They say a beautiful woman can turn a cold cell into a gilded hall.

492
33:32.025 --> 33:34.545
Seeing what you look like now,

493
33:34.625 --> 33:38.425
even a gilded hall cannot outshine your charm.

494
33:43.585 --> 33:47.825
Unfortunately, the heir won't see it tonight.

495
33:50.905 --> 33:53.065
It's all right, Fourth Aunt.

496
33:53.145 --> 33:54.905
The heir is a blessed man.

497
33:54.985 --> 33:56.105
He will recover one day.

498
33:56.865 --> 33:58.665
I hope he wakes up soon.

499
33:58.745 --> 34:02.985
He will be over the moon when he sees how beautiful his wife is.

500
34:04.225 --> 34:05.585
Oh, Governess Miao.

501
34:07.385 --> 34:08.824
Greetings, Madam.

502
34:09.344 --> 34:12.105
This is Governess Miao, Mother's confidant.

503
34:12.185 --> 34:14.425
If you ever need anything,

504
34:14.505 --> 34:18.665
or if your servant is disrespecting you, just go to her.

505
34:23.545 --> 34:26.465
Someone sent by the Duchess?

506
34:26.545 --> 34:28.705
She's clearly here to take over Songyue Hall.

507
34:28.784 --> 34:31.025
Grandmother sure has thought of everything.

508
34:31.985 --> 34:33.705
The heir is sick,

509
34:33.784 --> 34:35.065
and I'm young and inexperienced.

510
34:36.304 --> 34:38.185
I shall learn from you, Governess Miao.

511
34:38.264 --> 34:40.105
Once I'm familiar with everything,

512
34:40.185 --> 34:41.505
I'll care for the heir myself,

513
34:42.105 --> 34:43.985
that Governess may be spared the hardship.

514
34:44.905 --> 34:48.264
I will do my best to assist you, Madam.

515
34:48.344 --> 34:50.465
They are all aware of Lu Zhuo's condition,

516
34:50.545 --> 34:52.264
so they won't disturb you tonight.

517
34:52.905 --> 34:54.905
You have had an eventful day, so you must be tired.

518
34:54.985 --> 34:55.824
Rest now.

519
34:56.425 --> 34:58.545
You can greet the elderly tomorrow morning.

520
34:59.105 --> 34:59.945
I shall take my leave now.

521
35:01.505 --> 35:02.705
Take care, Fourth Aunt.

522
35:09.145 --> 35:10.025
Madam,

523
35:10.545 --> 35:14.065
allow me to lead your servants to settle down.

524
35:14.585 --> 35:16.585
No need for that.

525
35:16.665 --> 35:18.625
Madam is used to my and Bitao's service.

526
35:18.705 --> 35:19.545
GOVERNESS WU

527
35:19.625 --> 35:21.585
We cannot be away from her.

528
36:12.905 --> 36:15.985
Thanks to your quick wit, Madam. You had already prepared your answer

529
36:16.065 --> 36:17.585
and cleared Fourth Madam's doubts.

530
36:18.105 --> 36:21.225
This almond whitening ointment can rejuvenate skin.

531
36:21.745 --> 36:25.465
In a fortnight, your hands will be smooth and spotless.

532
36:27.305 --> 36:28.985
How is that enough?

533
36:29.065 --> 36:31.625
You have done hard labor.

534
36:31.705 --> 36:34.665
You're nothing like a noble lady.

535
36:34.745 --> 36:36.705
Since it's your first time in a prestigious family,

536
36:36.785 --> 36:38.585
there are many rules you don't know.

537
36:38.665 --> 36:40.105
Keep your mouth shut if you can.

538
36:40.865 --> 36:42.905
I can be your messenger.

539
36:42.985 --> 36:44.705
Speak more, and you might slip up.

540
36:44.785 --> 36:46.505
And if you slip up,

541
36:46.585 --> 36:48.265
the Earl's reputation will be ruined,

542
36:48.865 --> 36:51.265
even we servants would get dragged down.

543
36:51.865 --> 36:55.705
That Governess Miao is obviously an informant planted here.

544
36:56.745 --> 36:58.425
You have a special identity.

545
36:58.505 --> 37:00.585
Having outsiders here will just add unnecessary risks.

546
37:00.665 --> 37:02.865
You should remove them as soon as possible.

547
37:03.465 --> 37:05.385
Seems to me you're the informant.

548
37:07.305 --> 37:08.145
I've grown weary.

549
37:09.105 --> 37:10.345
We can talk tomorrow.

550
37:11.465 --> 37:12.865
Governess Wu, stay here.

551
37:12.945 --> 37:14.465
Attend the patient for his needs.

552
37:14.545 --> 37:15.785
What?

553
37:15.865 --> 37:18.105
First Madam assigned me here

554
37:18.185 --> 37:20.625
to teach you how to run a household and how to act like a lady.

555
37:20.705 --> 37:23.985
I… There's no way I can tend to the sick.

556
37:25.945 --> 37:27.505
If you can't handle such a small thing,

557
37:28.625 --> 37:30.425
don't stand there then.

558
37:30.505 --> 37:31.665
Find someone who can.

559
37:32.265 --> 37:33.745
I… You…

560
37:37.905 --> 37:41.185
I will do as Madam says. I shall take my leave now.

561
37:41.265 --> 37:45.465
BLISS

562
37:47.425 --> 37:49.505
Bitao, prepare me for bed.

563
37:53.345 --> 37:54.305
Is that how you say it?

564
37:55.465 --> 37:57.185
Yes, My Lady. You're so smart.

565
38:42.785 --> 38:45.425
It seems like fate hates you.

566
38:45.505 --> 38:47.145
It turns you into a living corpse,

567
38:48.425 --> 38:52.145
and even gives you a night soil collector as your wife.

568
38:54.985 --> 38:56.465
A poor woman from a humble family

569
38:56.985 --> 38:59.225
and a noble gentleman.

570
39:00.105 --> 39:01.425
It feels like a dream.

571
39:07.545 --> 39:09.225
I've spent five days practicing the etiquette.

572
39:09.865 --> 39:11.425
I cannot afford to slip up.

573
39:17.585 --> 39:18.705
Lord Lu.

574
39:19.425 --> 39:21.145
You are handsome,

575
39:21.225 --> 39:24.465
but you are gravely ill and emaciated.

576
39:24.985 --> 39:26.425
It makes you less attractive.

577
39:28.585 --> 39:31.265
Please turn around, for your face might frighten me at night.

578
39:32.905 --> 39:35.545
I know you can't move. Let me

579
39:36.225 --> 39:37.505
help you.

580
40:45.625 --> 40:47.625
You want to break off our engagement?

581
40:48.385 --> 40:50.225
In your dreams.

582
40:50.305 --> 40:52.625
You say I'm as venomous as a snake?

583
40:52.705 --> 40:53.545
How pitiful.

584
40:54.145 --> 40:56.705
You are destined to share a bed with one,

585
40:56.785 --> 41:00.305
and you'll never escape me for as long as you live.

586
41:18.065 --> 41:19.345
You're awake?

587
41:20.505 --> 41:21.745
Get away from me.

588
41:22.465 --> 41:23.465
What?

589
41:25.025 --> 41:26.265
Get away from my bed.

590
41:32.905 --> 41:33.785
Someone!

591
41:34.665 --> 41:36.945
Someone! The heir is awake!

592
41:37.785 --> 41:39.065
Someone!

593
41:39.145 --> 41:41.545
The heir is awake! Someone!

594
41:42.345 --> 41:43.665
-His Lordship. -His Lordship.

595
41:46.745 --> 41:48.105
Quick.

596
41:48.185 --> 41:51.585
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

597
41:51.665 --> 41:54.945
-His Lordship is awake. -His Lordship is awake.

598
41:55.505 --> 41:56.705
How wonderful.

599
42:24.865 --> 42:27.065
Does Lu Zhuo hold any grudges against Wei Rao?

600
42:27.785 --> 42:29.305
He looks at me as if I were a beast.

601
42:30.945 --> 42:33.625
His Lordship's pulse is steady. He is in good health.

602
42:33.705 --> 42:35.785
He is one lucky soul.

603
42:36.305 --> 42:38.025
However, he still needs to convalesce.

604
42:38.105 --> 42:39.185
All right.

605
42:39.265 --> 42:41.585
He woke up. Let's speak outside.

606
42:42.545 --> 42:43.545
Great news.

607
42:45.385 --> 42:46.225
Come, Physician Zhao.

608
42:52.625 --> 42:55.625
The toxin is still inside him, but he is no longer in danger.

609
42:56.505 --> 42:58.585
His Lordship just needs to rest.

610
42:58.665 --> 43:00.305
I'll write up a medicinal diet prescription.

611
43:00.385 --> 43:02.345
His Lordship hasn't eaten for a long time.

612
43:02.425 --> 43:05.425
He needs to have many small meals over the day to regain his vigor.

613
43:06.185 --> 43:09.545
Once he is nourished, his body will become strong again.

614
43:09.625 --> 43:12.465
The residual toxin will not hurt him.

615
43:12.545 --> 43:16.305
Physician Zhao, you have saved my grandson.

616
43:16.825 --> 43:19.465
Once Lu Zhuo makes a full recovery, I'll have him thank you in person.

617
43:20.185 --> 43:21.625
Governess Miao, please see him off.

618
43:22.985 --> 43:24.225
Farewell.

619
43:24.305 --> 43:25.985
How great.

620
43:26.065 --> 43:28.665
Zhuo finally woke up.

621
43:29.425 --> 43:33.105
This feels like a dream.

622
43:35.065 --> 43:36.265
Young child,

623
43:36.905 --> 43:38.465
it's all thanks to you.

624
43:39.065 --> 43:39.905
Back then,

625
43:39.985 --> 43:42.625
Lu Zhuo had fallen into a coma for days without any sign of waking.

626
43:43.225 --> 43:45.345
Even the imperial physicians were stumped.

627
43:45.425 --> 43:47.985
I had no choice

628
43:48.065 --> 43:50.665
but to beg for a marriage to turn over his luck.

629
43:51.585 --> 43:52.625
Given the circumstances,

630
43:52.705 --> 43:55.585
no one wanted to marry their daughter off like that.

631
43:55.665 --> 43:57.305
But Old Madam Wei

632
43:57.385 --> 44:00.265
was kind enough. She learned of our hardship,

633
44:00.345 --> 44:03.105
and you're generous enough to agree to this marriage.

634
44:04.025 --> 44:07.745
I will always remember this kindness from you.

635
44:08.545 --> 44:10.585
Yes, Rao.

636
44:10.665 --> 44:12.385
You are a blessing to the Lu family.

637
44:13.145 --> 44:16.265
Lu Zhuo will treat you with love and care.

638
44:16.345 --> 44:18.345
He will repay your favor.

639
44:18.945 --> 44:21.105
His Lordship is blessed by the gods.

640
44:21.185 --> 44:22.745
It is not my doing at all.

641
44:23.345 --> 44:24.785
However, His Lordship just woke up.

642
44:24.865 --> 44:26.065
He is quite weak now.

643
44:26.145 --> 44:28.705
Why don't all of you rest now?

644
44:29.385 --> 44:31.225
I shall look after His Lordship.

645
44:31.305 --> 44:33.145
Under the guidance of Governess Miao,

646
44:33.665 --> 44:35.025
I'm sure nothing will go wrong.

647
44:35.785 --> 44:36.905
Sure.

648
44:36.985 --> 44:42.025
Anyway, we can always talk once Lu Zhuo makes a full recovery. Come.

649
44:42.105 --> 44:43.465
Thank you so much.

650
44:43.545 --> 44:44.625
Let's go.

651
44:50.105 --> 44:51.545
Farewell.

652
45:28.665 --> 45:31.825
Turning over my luck? That's nonsense.

653
45:32.625 --> 45:34.225
I woke up

654
45:38.105 --> 45:39.945
because it's not my time to die yet.

655
45:40.745 --> 45:41.985
As to you,

656
45:42.705 --> 45:44.385
you venomous, treacherous woman.

657
45:44.465 --> 45:46.625
Who are you after this time?

658
45:50.265 --> 45:51.345
Jiede.

659
45:52.545 --> 45:53.705
Jiede.

660
45:58.505 --> 45:59.665
Your Lordship.

661
46:00.265 --> 46:01.545
Bring my servant here.

662
46:05.425 --> 46:07.225
Now!

663
46:11.265 --> 46:14.545
Compared to Your Lordship's thoroughness, I sure am short-sighted.

664
46:15.705 --> 46:16.545
Bitao,

665
46:17.065 --> 46:18.185
His Lordship will often need to see

666
46:18.265 --> 46:20.105
the physician and the male servants.

667
46:20.185 --> 46:21.385
The female servants in the rear court will be an inconvenience.

668
46:22.145 --> 46:24.705
Therefore, he will move to the study to recuperate.

669
46:24.785 --> 46:27.585
Inform Governess Miao of that decision and tell her to inform Old Madam as well.

670
46:27.665 --> 46:29.865
Then, tell Jiede in the study in the front court

671
46:29.945 --> 46:33.185
to bring several attentive helpers with him tomorrow morning.

672
46:34.145 --> 46:35.185
Yes.

673
46:46.105 --> 46:48.065
Old Madam and Mother prayed so hard

674
46:48.985 --> 46:50.145
for you to wake up.

675
46:50.225 --> 46:52.825
Your Lordship, it is imperative that you take good care of yourself.

676
46:52.905 --> 46:54.185
Avoid emotional outbursts

677
46:54.785 --> 46:56.545
lest the elderly worry about you.

678
46:56.625 --> 46:58.065
You don't want to be unfilial, do you?

679
46:58.825 --> 47:00.905
Not only are you a venomous snake,

680
47:01.425 --> 47:03.185
you are also a hypocritical snake

681
47:04.065 --> 47:06.305
with a silver tongue.

682
47:07.345 --> 47:08.305
Get away from me!

683
49:22.585 --> 49:24.505
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
